# Headless twm: this X server has no input devices (no mouse/kbd modules in
# the image), so twm's default interactive window placement — grab the server,
# draw the outline grid, wait for a click — would freeze the whole desktop
# forever on the first mapped window (spincube blocks mid-XPutImage under the
# grab). Place windows automatically and never grab the server.
RandomPlacement
NoGrabServer
